  "description": "H.264 (AVC) decoding and encoding for Egami.Video, in managed code: decodes Constrained Baseline, Main, High, High 10 and High 4:2:2 streams, progressive and interlaced, in MP4, MOV, Matroska, AVI and raw .h264 files; encodes 8-bit 4:2:0 in Constrained Baseline, Main and High. H.264 is covered by patents; Egami's authors grant no patent rights and are not lawyers. Whether you need a patent licence depends on your country and on how you use and distribute this package; commercial products may need one from the AVC patent pools or holders. Egami.Video itself contains no H.264 codec and does not depend on this package.",
